(7670577, 1252168, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be a vision one might see when you close your eyes.  Abstract enough of a concept, yet interesting to look at.  Good luck.</td>', 'This has the potential to be a vision one might see when you close your eyes.  Abstract enough of a concept, yet interesting to look at.  Good luck.', '2020-07-22 20:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
