(7670589, 1251799, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like it, and can definitely see it as a for real image in front of closed eyes.  The smiley lighter area is my only nit.  Good luck</td>', 'I like it, and can definitely see it as a for real image in front of closed eyes.  The smiley lighter area is my only nit.  Good luck', '2020-07-22 21:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7670590, 1252170, 30049, '<td valign="top">Whoa Batman!  BAM-POW!  That''s some bright light!!!  I like the abstract, non-pretty take, but it is very, very, let''s say luminous.  It''s funny, as I''m writing this comment the image is only partly visible and I see a fist with a Victory or Peace sign being presented.  I wonder if you can find the same "crop" that shows it?  :-)</td>', 'Whoa Batman!  BAM-POW!  That''s some bright light!!!  I like the abstract, non-pretty take, but it is very, very, let''s say luminous.  It''s funny, as I''m writing this comment the image is only partly visible and I see a fist with a Victory or Peace sign being presented.  I wonder if you can find the same "crop" that shows it?  :-)', '2020-07-22 21:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7670591, 1252128, 30049, '<td valign="top">Dang.  I must not be taking the correct pills before I close my eyes - many very bright images in this challenge.  It''s pretty.</td>', 'Dang.  I must not be taking the correct pills before I close my eyes - many very bright images in this challenge.  It''s pretty.', '2020-07-22 21:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7670592, 1252157, 30049, '<td valign="top">What''s with the 3rd person viewpoint?  Is this something you''d actually "see" when you close your eyes?  It''s very cool from an Extended "photoshop" perspective.  Just not what I was expecting from this challenge theme.</td>', 'What''s with the 3rd person viewpoint?  Is this something you''d actually "see" when you close your eyes?  It''s very cool from an Extended "photoshop" perspective.  Just not what I was expecting from this challenge theme.', '2020-07-22 21:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7670593, 1252115, 30049, '<td valign="top">You really should eat before you close your eyes.  LOL  Now if this had some dark blurry edges I could see it.  Have to admin, my mouth is watering a little.  :-P</td>', 'You really should eat before you close your eyes.  LOL  Now if this had some dark blurry edges I could see it.  Have to admin, my mouth is watering a little.  :-P', '2020-07-22 21:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
