(7670657, 1252168, 67145, '<td valign="top">its interesting the whole concept of this challenge .. as for everyone it conjures up something different .. because when we close our eyes .. often thats when our thoughts run riot .. <br/>if we are of a positive bent .. then our thoughts might turn to things that make us happy and content .. if we are inclined to the negative .. then that could be the direction our thoughts turn .. <br/>in this 2020 covid time .. i could imagine a lot of ppl would be feeling increasing uncertainty .. <br/>but hopefully the ppl who feel hopeful and positive will outweight those who feel doom approaching .. <br/>our energy has a great effect on not just ourselves, but the ppl around us and our planet .. <br/>this image speaks volumes .. and its very impactful .. :)</td>', 'its interesting the whole concept of this challenge .. as for everyone it conjures up something different .. because when we close our eyes .. often thats when our thoughts run riot .. if we are of a positive bent .. then our thoughts might turn to things that make us happy and content .. if we are inclined to the negative .. then that could be the direction our thoughts turn .. in this 2020 covid time .. i could imagine a lot of ppl would be feeling increasing uncertainty .. but hopefully the ppl who feel hopeful and positive will outweight those who feel doom approaching .. our energy has a great effect on not just ourselves, but the ppl around us and our planet .. this image speaks volumes .. and its very impactful .. :)', '2020-07-23 21:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
