(7670809, 1252157, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Im wondering do you shave your head for every image that you take of yourself hairless, or is it a fleshly cap?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I thought of shaving it, but my wife would probably kill me. I''m cloning my hair out each time. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ha yeah Im with your wife, you have a good set of hair better to keep it. And that hook you held your lip up with sure sounded nasty, the things you do, kudos to you.</td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban: Originally posted by Neat: Im wondering do you shave your head for every image that you take of yourself hairless, or is it a fleshly cap?  I thought of shaving it, but my wife would probably kill me. I''m cloning my hair out each time.   Ha yeah Im with your wife, you have a good set of hair better to keep it. And that hook you held your lip up with sure sounded nasty, the things you do, kudos to you.', '2020-07-25 08:49:18.000000', NULL, 0),
