(7670919, 1252157, 28742, '<td valign="top">Wow, Christophe, great to see your work again. Always an amazing inspiration. Congratulations!<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Im wondering do you shave your head for every image that you take of yourself hairless, or is it a fleshly cap?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I thought of shaving it, but my wife would probably kill me. I''m cloning my hair out each time. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Me, too, that''s what I always do. It''s tedious. ;-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2020-07-27 06:13:09.</i></td>', 'Wow, Christophe, great to see your work again. Always an amazing inspiration. Congratulations! Originally posted by gyaban: Originally posted by Neat: Im wondering do you shave your head for every image that you take of yourself hairless, or is it a fleshly cap? I thought of shaving it, but my wife would probably kill me. I''m cloning my hair out each time.   Me, too, that''s what I always do. It''s tedious. ;-)', '2020-07-27 07:12:41.000000', '2020-07-27 07:13:09.000000', 0),
